      "observed": "All listed VDD pins on both MCUs are unconnected. NAVC2's VSS pins are on an isolated net rather than GND. The netlist shows REG3.1 on +3.3V, but that rail does not connect to the MCUs' VDD pins.",
      "expected": "Both MCUs' VDD pins should connect to the regulated 3.3 V rail and their VSS pins to ground. The specification says the 3.3 V rail supplies both MCUs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"unconnected-(FCC2-VDD-Pad11)\") ... (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"11\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"unconnected-(NAVC2-VDD-Pad19)\") ... (ref \"NAVC2\") (pin \"19\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"Net-(NAVC2-VSS-Pad18)\") ... (ref \"NAVC2\") (pin \"18\") ... (pin \"63\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "3.3 V feeds both MCUs (FCC, NAVC) and all I2C sensor ICs"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The MCUs have no schematic connection to their supply pins, so they cannot operate as intended; NAVC also lacks a ground connection on its VSS pins.",
      "confidence": 1.0
    },
    {
      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": ["HSE2", "HSE3", "FCC2", "NAVC2", "R52", "R42"],
      "pins": ["FCC2.12", "FCC2.13", "FCC2.5", "FCC2.37", "NAVC2.5", "NAVC2.6", "HSE2.1", "HSE2.3", "HSE3.1", "HSE3.3"],
      "nets": ["NET0116", "NET0175", "Net-(C73-Pad1)", "NET0166", "Net-(C35-Pad1)", "NET0141"],
      "observed": "Neither crystal is connected to the MCU's PH0/PH1 oscillator pins. HSE2 is instead connected to FCC2 PE6 and, through R52, PE7; HSE3's crystal terminals connect to passive-component nets with no NAVC2 pin.",
      "expected": "Each 25 MHz HSE crystal should connect to its MCU's HSE oscillator input/output pins. The specification identifies an HSE crystal for both MCUs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"NET0116\") ... (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"5\") (pinfunction \"PE6\") ... (ref \"HSE2\") (pin \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"NET0175\") ... (ref \"FCC2\") (pin \"37\") (pinfunction \"PE7\") (ref \"R52\") (pin \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"NET0166\") ... (ref \"HSE3\") (pin \"1\") ... (ref \"C50\") (pin \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "HSE crystal (both MCUs)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The MCUs' external high-speed clock circuits cannot use the specified crystals, preventing or disrupting operation that depends on the intended HSE clock.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    },
    {
      "category": "open_connection",
      "components": ["NAVC2", "U18", "U4", "U1", "U16", "U6"],
      "pins": ["NAVC2.8", "NAVC2.9", "NAVC2.10", "NAVC2.11", "U18.9", "U4.4", "U1.6", "U16.2", "U6.3", "U18.8", "U4.1", "U1.1", "U16.3", "U6.1"],
      "nets": ["NET0052", "NET0078"],
      "observed": "The sensor SDA signals share NET0052 and the sensor SCL signals share NET0078, but neither net connects to NAVC2. The listed NAVC2 pins are unconnected.",
      "expected": "The NAVC MCU should connect to the sensor I2C bus so it can gather IMU, magnetometer, pressure, and temperature data, as specified.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"NET0052\") ... (ref \"U16\") (pin \"2\") ... (ref \"U18\") (pin \"9\") ... (ref \"U4\") (pin \"4\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (name \"NET0078\") ... (ref \"U16\") (pin \"3\") ... (ref \"U18\") (pin \"8\") ... (ref \"U4\") (pin \"1\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "Navigation Computer (NAVC) — gathers IMU, magnetometer, pressure sensor and GPS receiver data"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "Even if powered, NAVC cannot communicate with the on-board I2C sensors and therefore cannot perform its specified sensor-gathering role.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    }
  ],
  "summary": "Anomalies are present: both MCUs have unconnected supply pins, the NAVC ground pins are isolated, and the HSE crystals and sensor I2C buses are not connected to the expected MCU pins. These omissions prevent the board from fulfilling its intended flight-control and navigation functions."
}

